1
00:00:00,827 --> 00:00:03,557
(Amy:)because Google changed
their font?

2
00:00:03,563 --> 00:00:05,563
(Meemaw:)Young lady,

3
00:00:05,565 --> 00:00:07,235
(Meemaw:)if you think I don't know

4
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:08,463
(Meemaw:)what it's like to live

5
00:00:08,468 --> 00:00:10,568
(Meemaw:)with a stubborn,
egotistical man,

6
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,900
(Meemaw:)then you're wrong.

7
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:13,935
'Cause that was my husband.

8
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,670
(Leonard:)Really?

9
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:16,905
(sighs)

10
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,640
(Meemaw:)There were days I wanted to fill
his pockets with corn

11
00:00:19,646 --> 00:00:22,176
(Meemaw:)and toss him in the pigpen.

12
00:00:23,016 --> 00:00:25,246
(Amy:)Well, if you understand,

13
00:00:25,251 --> 00:00:27,921
(Amy:)then why are you giving me
such a hard time?

14
00:00:27,921 --> 00:00:30,021
(Meemaw:)Because when you broke up
with Sheldon,

15
00:00:30,023 --> 00:00:31,323
(Meemaw:)it hurt him deeply,

16
00:00:31,324 --> 00:00:33,754
(Meemaw:)and I don't want to see
that happen again.

17
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,960
(door opens)

18
00:00:34,961 --> 00:00:36,931
(Penny:)Hi. Sorry.

19
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,160
(Penny:)Sheldon would like
to say something to you.

20
00:00:39,165 --> 00:00:40,235
SHELDON:
No, I wouldn't.

21
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:41,533
(Leonard:)Just get in here.

22
00:00:42,936 --> 00:00:43,966
(Sheldon:)Hello.

23
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,440
(Penny:)Go ahead.

24
00:00:45,438 --> 00:00:47,008
(Sheldon:)Meemaw, look,

25
00:00:47,006 --> 00:00:48,976
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, but...

26
00:00:48,975 --> 00:00:50,275
(Sheldon:)I have to defend

27
00:00:50,276 --> 00:00:52,206
(Sheldon:)my girlfriend to you.

28
00:00:52,212 --> 00:00:54,512
(Amy:)Oh, Sheldon, thank you.

29
00:00:54,514 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)Oh, great, now you're gonna
get emotional.

